  nodeId: PV - Page 4
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<b>Visuals</b>\r\nClose-up shot\u2014the killer stoops down over Marcus,
    checks his wrist for a pulse, and pulls a small vial of synthetic depressants
    from their pocket. They slide the vial deep inside Marcus's jacket pocket to
    fake an overdose.\r\n\r\n<b>Narrative:</b>\r\nCold and deliberate. Planting the
    poison to fake a financial suicide.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<i>No. of Panels: 4</i>\r\n<i>1.
    Killer stooping over</i>\r\n<i>2. Check wrist for pulse</i>\r\n<i>3. Pulls a
    small vial</i>\r\n<i>4. Slides into Marcus's pocket</i>\r\n\r"
